{"nodes": [{"id": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "label": "QueryException: Unknown column 'tenstrings_office_name' on inventory_items insert", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-09-04T13:10:16", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SQLSTATE[42S22] 1054 raised on portal.tenstrings.org (PHP 8.3.30, Laravel 12.53.0) during Filament import 12 of an inventory CSV. The CSV column 'TENSTRINGS OFFICE NAME' was mapped to a model attribute 'tenstrings_office_name' that has no matching column on inventory_items, so Eloquent put the helper value straight into the INSERT. Fix direction: strip CSV-only helper fields before save (resolve them into branch_id/inventory_room_id and the notes string instead)."}, {"id": "prompts_error_sqlstate_42s22_column_not_found", "label": "SQLSTATE[42S22] Column not found (MySQL 1054)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_csv_helper_field_leakage", "label": "CSV helper fields leaking into Eloquent insert", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An importer that keeps spreadsheet-only columns (office name, item code, raw item text) on the model record will crash at INSERT time with a column-not-found error. Helper columns must be consumed during resolution and then unset, never persisted."}, {"id": "prompts_error_tenstrings_office_name_csv_column", "label": "CSV column 'TENSTRINGS OFFICE NAME'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventory_items", "label": "inventory_items table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventoryitem", "label": "InventoryItem model", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventory_rooms", "label": "inventory_rooms table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventoryroom", "label": "InventoryRoom model", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_duplicate_inventory_room_creation", "label": "Duplicate inventory_rooms rows created per CSV row", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Database Queries section", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-09-04T13:10:15", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Second defect visible in the same query log: every CSV row runs `select * from inventory_rooms where (branch_id = 1 and code = 'IT-OFFICE') and deleted_at is null limit 1` and then still inserts a new 'IT OFFICE' room (ids 1..11 within one import). The firstOrCreate lookup never sees the row it just wrote \u2014 most likely because the write happens inside an uncommitted/rolled-back import transaction or the lookup runs on a stale/different connection. Result: 11 identical IT-OFFICE rooms and 11 activity_log 'created' entries for one office."}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventory_categories", "label": "inventory_categories table (slug lookup)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_failed_import_rows", "label": "failed_import_rows table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rows are written here even when validation_error is NULL, so the table is also recording successfully-parsed rows \u2014 a symptom worth checking alongside the import crash."}, {"id": "prompts_error_imports", "label": "imports table (import id 12)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_activity_log", "label": "activity_log table (spatie activitylog)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_login_sessions", "label": "login_sessions table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_duplicate_login_session_insert", "label": "Duplicate login_sessions insert on a single request", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Database Queries section", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-09-04T13:10:15", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same login_sessions row for user 410 is inserted twice at 13:10:15 on one POST /livewire/update, suggesting the login-tracking listener is registered twice or fires on both Login and Authenticated events."}, {"id": "prompts_error_cache_locks_queue_overlap", "label": "cache_locks queue overlap lock for ImportCsv", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lock key 'laravel-queue-overlap:Filament\\Actions\\Imports\\Jobs\\ImportCsv:import12' shows the import job runs under WithoutOverlapping per import id."}, {"id": "prompts_error_filament_importer", "label": "Filament\\Actions\\Imports\\Importer", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Stack Trace frames 9-10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_filament_importcsv_job", "label": "Filament\\Actions\\Imports\\Jobs\\ImportCsv", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Stack Trace frames 11-15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs the row insert inside DB::transaction (ManagesTransactions frame), which is why a mid-import crash can roll back rooms created earlier in the same batch."}, {"id": "prompts_error_livewire_update_endpoint", "label": "POST /livewire/update (default.livewire.update)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Request / Route Context", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The import was triggered synchronously from the Livewire update round-trip on /inventory/inventory-items, so the queued ImportCsv exception surfaced as a 500 in the admin UI."}, {"id": "prompts_error_inventory_items_admin_page", "label": "/inventory/inventory-items admin page", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Headers (referer)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "prompts_error_item_field_required_validation", "label": "Validation error: 'The iTEM field is required.'", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 165", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blank CSV rows fail with an awkwardly cased attribute label ('iTEM'), showing the importer derives validation labels from raw uppercase CSV headers instead of declared column labels."}, {"id": "prompts_error_asset_tag_scheme", "label": "Asset tag scheme TS-<office>-<sequence>", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tags such as TS-IT-000..TS-IT-010 and TS-AJA-AUD-0001 are probed with a per-tag `select exists(... where asset_tag = ?)` before each insert, so uniqueness is enforced by lookup rather than a DB constraint."}, {"id": "prompts_error_duplicate_name_guard", "label": "Case-insensitive duplicate item guard (LOWER(name) per room)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Before inserting, the importer checks `exists(... branch_id = ? and inventory_room_id = ? and LOWER(name) = ? and deleted_at is null)` so re-running a CSV does not duplicate items; the guard is scoped per branch and room and ignores soft-deleted rows."}], "edges": [{"source": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "target": "prompts_error_sqlstate_42s22_column_not_found", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "target": "prompts_error_inventory_items", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "target": "prompts_error_tenstrings_office_name_csv_column", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "line 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_csv_helper_field_leakage", "target": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_tenstrings_office_name_csv_column", "target": "prompts_error_csv_helper_field_leakage", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_filament_importcsv_job", "target": "prompts_error_filament_importer", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Stack Trace frames 9-15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_filament_importer", "target": "prompts_error_queryexception_unknown_column_tenstrings_office_name", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": "Stack Trace frame 9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_filament_importer", "target": "prompts_error_inventoryitem", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_inventoryitem", "target": "prompts_error_inventory_items", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_inventoryroom", "target": "prompts_error_inventory_rooms", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "prompts/error.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "prompts_error_filament_importcsv_job", "target": "prompts_error_imports", "relation": "references", "